        665.0,
        465.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "例 1 下列语句哪些是命题？如果是命题，那么它们是真命题还是假命题？为什么？"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b5",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95.0,
        470.0,
        665.0,
        645.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "(1) 个位数字是 5 的自然数能被 5 整除；",
            "(2) 凡直角三角形都相似；",
            "(3) 请起立；",
            "(4) 若两个角互为补角，则这两个角不相等；",
            "(5) 若两个三角形的三组对应边相等，则这两个三角形全等；",
            "(6) 你是高一学生吗？",
            "(7) $x>3$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
